      "title": "Finolex Industries Limited Recommends Special Dividend for the Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "Finolex Industries Limited announced that the Board of Directors of the Company held its meeting on 26 May 2026. Company Recommended a special dividend of INR 0.75 (37.50%) per equity share of INR 2/- each, aggregating to INR 2.75 (137.50%) per equity share of INR 2/- each for the year ended March 31, 2026, subject to deduction of tax, as applicable and approval of Members at the ensuing 45th Annual General Meeting; (The Company will inform the date of the Forty-Fifth (45th) Annual General Meeting and the dividend payment date in due course).",
      "keyDevTypeId": "94",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
