      "title": "Finolex Industries Limited Recommends Final Dividend for the Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "Finolex Industries Limited announced that the Board of Directors of the Company held its meeting on 26 May 2026. Company Recommended a final dividend of INR 2 (100%) per equity share of INR 2/- each aggregating to INR 2.75 (137.50%) per equity share of INR 2/- each for the year ended March 31, 2026, subject to deduction of tax, as applicable and approval of Members at the ensuing 45th Annual General Meeting; (The Company will inform the date of the Forty-Fifth (45th) Annual General Meeting and the dividend payment date in due course.).",
